  "contentHtml": "<p style=\"text-align: left;\">3월 14일<br>나는 학교 정보 선생님과 <br><br>과학 센서 동아리인 센서 메이커스와<br><br>코딩 동아리인 비트 메이커스를 개설하여<br><br>교내 연합 동아리로 활동하기로 했다.<br><br>예산은 STEAM클럽 예산을 2팀으로 각각 신청했다.<br>=&gt; 아쉽게 한 팀만 선정되었다! <br>그래도 하나라도 되어서 다행이다 정말<br>&#8203;<br><br>전체적인 흐름은 아래와 같이 진행하려한다.<br><br>1단계: 센서 실험 진행과 바이브 코딩으로 예비 탐구 시뮬레이션 만들기<br><br>2단계: 센서 실험 값을 컴퓨터 화면에 자신이 원하는 대로 나타내기(밝기가 줄어들면, 컴퓨터 속 센서등이 켜지게 만들기 등)<br><br>3단계: 센서를 활용하여 실제 외부로 작동하는 물건 제작(온도 센서와 모터로 에어컨 모형 제작, 밝기 센서로 센서등 제작 =&gt; 이걸 미니어쳐로 조별로 다르게 만들어서 결국에는 하나의 IoT집이 된다!)<br></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7fc730305d697a0087cbdfe83b1f76bef8769668\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7fc730305d697a0087cbdfe83b1f76bef8769668\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"585\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">온도 센서를 잡고 시연하는 모습</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9079b29db9bb8234e89f22afe9377da8f2105f9e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9079b29db9bb8234e89f22afe9377da8f2105f9e\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"667\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">공기압 센서 시연 모습</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/df189fc4faf208c721e71581af96c2276b8c8fe2\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/df189fc4faf208c721e71581af96c2276b8c8fe2\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">그 다음날 센서 모아서 컴퓨터실로!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3caa5dfd64153f580f90730941561a639be2c278\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/3caa5dfd64153f580f90730941561a639be2c278\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이지메이커 보드에 대해서 자세한 설명</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8ece89e62cfa9b70a5405e8e761d82b36cd6d414\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/8ece89e62cfa9b70a5405e8e761d82b36cd6d414\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"675\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">온도 센서 들어봐라!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/98e642432f639c1dbe8e5083f0de520504d07cd8\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/98e642432f639c1dbe8e5083f0de520504d07cd8\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ca0791e0655ce8d9e14467e263c65af37e472904\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ca0791e0655ce8d9e14467e263c65af37e472904\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c105ca8dedf3c99e1e1579952bd6162f19b8afa5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c105ca8dedf3c99e1e1579952bd6162f19b8afa5\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">온도 센서 2개를 양손으로!!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a4193671c1db1810fbd4ad5567b83e9adc356d0d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/a4193671c1db1810fbd4ad5567b83e9adc356d0d\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c52905c46679f9f4fea45e044264cf6152cc16b5\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c52905c46679f9f4fea45e044264cf6152cc16b5\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"984\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">공기압 센서도 학생들이 되게 재밌어 했다.</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/51b219971bf0ef55bfa367d8c05d22f600654804\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/51b219971bf0ef55bfa367d8c05d22f600654804\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"854\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f0b90e1600f492a2a71f324bd0b3b28cb0788b39\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/f0b90e1600f492a2a71f324bd0b3b28cb0788b39\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">지능형 과학실 ON으로 데이터 전송까지 완료!</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/731434c0d024d3cc0995674faca4a8cd0c55244d\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/731434c0d024d3cc0995674faca4a8cd0c55244d\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"675\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bbf254d7dff19c0fe77dfff31bec9bb38aeaf1e\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/6bbf254d7dff19c0fe77dfff31bec9bb38aeaf1e\" data-origin-width=\"900\" data-origin-height=\"900\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">마지막엔 애들과 정보쌤 그리고 나!<br><br>기념사진 촬영까지 완료&#128293;<br><br>&#8203;<br><br>앞으로 종종 경과 보고를 해야겠다.<br><br>그리고 어제 3월 25일!!<br>융합교육(STEAM) 클럽에 선정되었다ㅎㅎ</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c0d77e970ee39bdc7d8e6fb1af27136690c4288\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4c0d77e970ee39bdc7d8e6fb1af27136690c4288\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"656\"></div><p style=\"text-align: left;\">이제 정보쌤은 아두이노, 나는 이지메이커 센서를<br>사면서 동아리를 이어 나갈 것 같다.<br><br>[네이버 블로그] 블로그를 소개합니다.<br>쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 | 최효석<br><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111</a></p><div class=\"figure-open\" contenteditable=\"false\" data-ke-type=\"opengraph\" data-ke-align=\"alignCenter\" data-og-type=\"website\" data-og-title=\"쿼카쌤의 수업꾸러미 : 네이버 블로그\" data-og-description=\"영서중학교 과학교사(물리 전공)입니다! 항상 새로운 수업을 만들고자 합니다\" data-og-host=\"m.blog.naver.com\" data-og-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" data-og-image=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/kbXOh/dJMb85vOB0x/QD0mwEIgfHKjpjk6OECKU0/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=204&amp;height=204\"><a href=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\" target=\"_blank\" data-source-url=\"https://m.blog.naver.com/chlgytjr111\"><div class=\"og-image\"><img class=\"thumb_img\" src=\"http://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/kbXOh/dJMb85vOB0x/QD0mwEIgfHKjpjk6OECKU0/kakaolink40_original.jpg?width=20